%Name = "Pressure High"
%MapFile = "Pressure.map"

%LevelBriefing = "PRESSURE HIGH

Use these former high school's buildings to create a neat hospital. This time around 
you need to focus on your reputation, which also means killing patients won't be tolerated.

Be clever about this, don't rely on luck. But good luck!"

%LevelDebriefing = "Hell yeah! You cured so many, wow."

